<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Hudson County Improvement Auth, NJ.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Hudson County Improvement Auth, NJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>HUDSON COUNTY IMPROVEMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $29,660,000</p>
<p>(COUNTY OF HUDSON, NEW JERSEY)</p>
<p>FACILITY LEASE TAXABLE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(ADMINISTRATION BUILDING PROJECT, SERIES 1996)</p>
<p>Effective at 11:30 A.M. E.S.T., Thursday, December 19, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>E.A. Moos &amp; Co.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>Powell Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>William E. Simon &amp; Sons Municipal Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
